- Fix a vulnerability reported by [MrHodl](https://github.com/MrHodlX)
  Bark didn't check a lightning receive for repeated HTLC VTXOs. On the
  filestore and IndexedDB back-ends, a server could list one VTXO twice and
  get the preimage while paying only part of the invoice amount. Bark now
  aborts the receive on a repeated VTXO.
  [#2821](https://gitlab.com/ark-bitcoin/bark/-/merge_requests/2821)
